    "created_at": "2018-09-21T15:46:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-09-21T15:46:11Z",
    "body": "AFAIK, WebKit does not implement this (fetch, XMLHttpRequest, EventSource).\r\nQuickly looking at WebSocket implementation, it does not seem to be implemented this way either, though that might be interesting in that case.\r\n",
