    "created_at": "2018-09-25T11:05:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-09-25T11:05:40Z",
    "body": "Chrome won't abort a fetch due to garbage collection. We also aren't able to GC XMLHttpRequest when it is in action.\r\n\r\nHowever, with future refactorings, cancel-on-GC might become the natural semantics.\r\n\r\nWe also don't aggressively implement the WebSocket GC semantics described in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#garbage-collection-3, although we probably could without too much trouble.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
