    "created_at": "2018-09-26T02:59:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-09-26T02:59:15Z",
    "body": "I would believe that a fetch would be collectable at least when the load finishes, no matter whether all data is read or not.\r\nI wonder whether some applications actually rely on the current behavior (no GC until load finishes), especially if it is consistent across browsers.\r\nI could also see some web apps use 'fetch(url)' in a similar way to beacon.",
