    "created_at": "2018-09-26T04:25:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-09-26T04:25:00Z",
    "body": "Yeah, I'm skeptical that GC stopping a network load is web compatible if all major browsers are currently not exhibiting that behavior.\r\n\r\nIs any browser actively pursuing & intending to ship that behavioral change? Perhaps we should remove this clause from the spec until such a time is reached that at least one major browser has shipped this behavior change, and at least one other vendor is moving forward with such a behavior.",
